# `compression` reads a compressed file whose name says nothing about it; `infer_rows` limits
# how many rows the schema is inferred from.
mode: run
---- query
from read_csv('../../data/compressed/orders.dat', compression = 'gzip', infer_rows = 5)
| where orderId == 'o-0001'
---- expected
orderId | customerId | amount | timestamp
string  | string     | real   | datetime
--------+------------+--------+---------------------
o-0001  | c-042      |  183.5 | 2023-12-02T08:26:08Z
